"This bot is currently **serverlocked**, meaning that it is locked to its "
"current servers and will leave any server it joins."
msgstr "此机器人当前处于**服务器锁定**状态，这意味着它被锁定在其当前服务器上，并会离开它加入的任何新服务器。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:1516
#, docstring
msgid "Commands to setup [botname]'s invite settings."
msgstr "用于设置[botname] 邀请设置的命令"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:1521
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Toggles if `[p]invite` should be accessible for the average user.\n"
"\n"
"        The bot must be made into a `Public bot` in the developer dashboard for public invites to work.\n"
"\n"
"        **Example:**\n"
"        - `[p]inviteset public yes` - Toggles the public invite setting.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `[confirm]` - Required to set to public. Not required to toggle back to private.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        切换 `[p]invite` 是否对普通用户可用。\n"
"\n"
"        机器人必须在开发者面板中设置为 `Public bot` 才能使公开邀请生效。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]inviteset public yes` - 切换公开邀请设置。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `[confirm]` - 设置为公开时需要。切换回私密时不需要。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:1558
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Make the bot create its own role with permissions on join.\n"
"\n"
"        The bot will create its own role with the desired permissions when it joins a new server. This is a special role that can't be deleted or removed from the bot.\n"
"\n"
"        For that, you need to provide a valid permissions level.\n"
"        You can generate one here: https://discordapi.com/permissions.html\n"
"\n"
"        Please note that you might need two factor authentication for some permissions.\n"
"\n"
"        **Example:**\n"
"        - `[p]inviteset perms 134217728` - Adds a \"Manage Nicknames\" permission requirement to the invite.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `<level>` - The permission level to require for the bot in the generated invite.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        使机器人在加入时创建具有权限的自身角色。\n"
"\n"
"        当机器人加入新服务器时，它将创建具有所需权限的自身角色。这是一个无法删除或从机器人移除的特殊角色。\n"
"\n"
"        为此，你需要提供有效的权限级别。\n"
"        你可以在此处生成一个：https://discordapi.com/permissions.html\n"
"\n"
"        请注意，某些权限可能需要双因素认证。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]inviteset perms 134217728` - 为邀请添加\"管理昵称\"权限要求。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `<level>` - 生成的邀请中机器人所需的权限级别。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:1579
#, docstring
