#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:1966
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Base command for managing what application commands are able to be used on "
"[botname]."
msgstr "用于管理 [botname] 上可用的应用程序命令的基本命令。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:1975
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Marks an application command as being enabled, allowing it to be added to the bot.\n"
"\n"
"        See commands available to enable with `[p]slash list`.\n"
"\n"
"        This command does NOT sync the enabled commands with Discord, that must be done manually with `[p]slash sync` for commands to appear in users' clients.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"            - `<command_name>` - The command name to enable. Only the top level name of a group command should be used.\n"
"            - `[command_type]` - What type of application command to enable. Must be one of `slash`, `message`, or `user`. Defaults to `slash`.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        将应用程序命令标记为启用，允许将其添加到机器人。\n"
"\n"
"        使用 `[p]slash list` 查看可启用的命令。\n"
"\n"
"        此命令不会将启用的命令同步到 Discord，必须手动使用 `[p]slash sync` 才能使命令出现在用户的客户端中。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"            - `<command_name>` - 要启用的命令名称。对于组命令，只应使用顶级名称。\n"
"            - `[command_type]` - 要启用的应用程序命令类型。必须是 `slash`、`message` 或 `user` 之一。默认为 `slash`。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:2000 redbot/core/core_commands.py:2059
msgid "Command type must be one of `slash`, `message`, or `user`."
msgstr "命令类型必须是 `slash`、`message` 或 `user` 之一。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:2007
msgid "That application command is already enabled."
msgstr "该应用程序命令已启用。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:2012
msgid ""
"That application command could not be found. Use `{prefix}slash list` to see"
" all application commands. You may need to double check the command type."
msgstr "找不到该应用程序命令。使用 `{prefix}slash list` 查看所有应用程序命令。你可能需要再次确认命令类型。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:2023
msgid "The command limit has been reached. Disable a command first."
msgstr "已达到命令限制。请先禁用一个命令。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:2028
msgid "Enabled {command_type} application command `{command_name}`"
msgstr "已启用 {command_type} 应用程序命令 `{command_name}`"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:2040
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Marks an application command as being disabled, preventing it from being added to the bot.\n"
"\n"
"        See commands available to disable with `[p]slash list`.\n"
"\n"
"        This command does NOT sync the enabled commands with Discord, that must be done manually with `[p]slash sync` for commands to appear in users' clients.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"            - `<command_name>` - The command name to disable. Only the top level name of a group command should be used.\n"
"            - `[command_type]` - What type of application command to disable. Must be one of `slash`, `message`, or `user`. Defaults to `slash`.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        将应用程序命令标记为禁用，防止其添加到机器人。\n"
"\n"
"        使用 `[p]slash list` 查看可禁用的命令。\n"
"\n"
"        此命令不会将启用的命令同步到 Discord，必须手动使用 `[p]slash sync` 才能使命令出现在用户的客户端中。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"            - `<command_name>` - 要禁用的命令名称。对于组命令，只应使用顶级名称。\n"
"            - `[command_type]` - 要禁用的应用程序命令类型。必须是 `slash`、`message` 或 `user` 之一。默认为 `slash`。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:2065
msgid ""
"That application command has been set as required for the cog to function by"
" the author, and cannot be disabled. The cog must be unloaded to remove the "
"command."
msgstr "该应用程序命令已被作者设置为齿轮运行所必需，无法禁用。必须卸载该齿轮才能移除该命令。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:2077
