"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]set bot custominfo >>> I can use **markdown** such as quotes, ||spoilers|| and multiple lines.`\n"
"        - `[p]set bot custominfo Join my [support server](discord.gg/discord)!`\n"
"        - `[p]set bot custominfo` - 移除自定义信息文本。\n"
"\n"
