msgstr "设置 [botname] 的服务器管理员和版主角色。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:3382
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Adds an admin role for this server.\n"
"\n"
"        Admins have the same access as Mods, plus additional admin level commands like:\n"
"         - `[p]set serverprefix`\n"
"         - `[p]addrole`\n"
"         - `[p]ban`\n"
"         - `[p]ignore guild`\n"
"\n"
"         And more.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]set roles addadminrole @Admins`\n"
"        - `[p]set roles addadminrole Super Admins`\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `<role>` - The role to add as an admin.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        为此服务器添加管理员角色。\n"
"\n"
"        管理员拥有与版主相同的访问权限，外加额外的管理员级别命令，如：\n"
"         - `[p]set serverprefix`\n"
"         - `[p]addrole`\n"
"         - `[p]ban`\n"
"         - `[p]ignore guild`\n"
"\n"
"         以及更多。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]set roles addadminrole @Admins`\n"
"        - `[p]set roles addadminrole Super Admins`\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `<role>` - 要添加为管理员的角色。\n"
"        "

