#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4223
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Set a global bot variable for using buttons in menus.\n"
"\n"
"        When enabled, all usage of cores menus API will use buttons instead of reactions.\n"
"\n"
"        This defaults to False.\n"
"        Using this without a setting will toggle.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"            - `[p]set usebuttons True` - Enables using buttons.\n"
"            - `[p]helpset usebuttons` - Toggles the value.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"            - `[use_buttons]` - Whether to use buttons. Leave blank to toggle.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        设置一个全局机器人变量，用于在菜单中使用按钮。\n"
"\n"
"        启用后，所有使用核心菜单 API 的操作将使用按钮而非反应。\n"
"\n"
"        默认值为 False。\n"
"        不提供设置则会切换。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"            - `[p]set usebuttons True` - 启用使用按钮。\n"
"            - `[p]helpset usebuttons` - 切换值。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"            - `[use_buttons]` - 是否使用按钮。留空以切换。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4242
msgid "I will use buttons on basic menus."
msgstr "我将在基本菜单上使用按钮。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4244
msgid "I will not use buttons on basic menus."
msgstr "我不会在基本菜单上使用按钮。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4249
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Set the message that will be sent on uncaught bot errors.\n"
"\n"
"        To include the command name in the message, use the `{command}` placeholder.\n"
"\n"
"        If you omit the `msg` argument, the message will be reset to the default one.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"            - `[p]set errormsg` - Resets the error message back to the default: \"Error in command '{command}'.\". If the command invoker is one of the bot owners, the message will also include \"Check your console or logs for details.\".\n"
"            - `[p]set errormsg Oops, the command {command} has failed! Please try again later.` - Sets the error message to a custom one.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"            - `[msg]` - The custom error message. Must be less than 1000 characters. Omit to reset to the default one.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        设置机器人未捕获错误时发送的消息。\n"
"\n"
"        要在消息中包含命令名称，请使用 `{command}` 占位符。\n"
"\n"
"        如果省略 `msg` 参数，消息将重置为默认值。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"            - `[p]set errormsg` - 将错误消息重置为默认值：\"命令 '{command}' 出错。\"。如果命令调用者是机器人所有者之一，消息还将包含\"请查看控制台或日志获取详细信息。\"。\n"
"            - `[p]set errormsg Oops, the command {command} has failed! Please try again later.` - 将错误消息设置为自定义消息。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"            - `[msg]` - 自定义错误消息。必须少于1000个字符。省略以重置为默认值。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4264
msgid "The message must be less than 1000 characters."
msgstr "消息必须少于1000个字符。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4268
msgid "Successfully updated the error message."
msgstr "已成功更新错误消息。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4271
msgid "Successfully reset the error message back to the default one."
msgstr "已成功将错误消息重置为默认值。"

