msgstr "帮助设置已重置为默认值。在使用第三方帮助格式化器时，这可能不会产生效果。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4351
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Allows the help command to be sent as a paginated menu instead of separate\n"
"        messages.\n"
"\n"
"        When \"reactions\", \"buttons\", \"select\", or \"selectonly\" is passed,\n"
"         `[p]help` will only show one page at a time\n"
"        and will use the associated control scheme to navigate between pages.\n"
"\n"
"         **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus reactions` - Enables using reaction menus.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus buttons` - Enables using button menus.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus select` - Enables buttons with a select menu.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus selectonly` - Enables a select menu only on help.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus disable` - Disables help menus.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"            - `<\"buttons\"|\"reactions\"|\"select\"|\"selectonly\"|\"disable\">` - Whether to use `buttons`,\n"
"            `reactions`, `select`, `selectonly`, or no menus.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        允许帮助命令以分页菜单的形式发送，而非分开的消息。\n"
"\n"
"        当传入 \"reactions\"、\"buttons\"、\"select\" 或 \"selectonly\" 时，\n"
"         `[p]help` 一次只显示一页，\n"
"        并使用相关的控制方案在页面之间导航。\n"
"\n"
"         **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus reactions` - 启用使用反应菜单。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus buttons` - 启用使用按钮菜单。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus select` - 启用带选择菜单的按钮。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus selectonly` - 仅对帮助启用选择菜单。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usemenus disable` - 禁用帮助菜单。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"            - `<\"buttons\"|\"reactions\"|\"select\"|\"selectonly\"|\"disable\">` - 是否使用 `buttons`、\n"
"            `reactions`、`select`、`selectonly` 或无菜单。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4371
msgid "Help will use the select menu only."
msgstr "帮助将仅使用选择菜单。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4374
msgid "Help will use button menus and add a select menu."
msgstr "帮助将使用按钮菜单并添加选择菜单。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4377
msgid "Help will use button menus."
msgstr "帮助将使用按钮菜单。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4380
msgid "Help will use reaction menus."
msgstr "帮助将使用反应菜单。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4383
msgid "Help will not use menus."
msgstr "帮助将不使用菜单。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4390
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        This allows the help command to show hidden commands.\n"
"\n"
"        This defaults to False.\n"
"        Using this without a setting will toggle.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset showhidden True` - Enables showing hidden commands.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset showhidden` - Toggles the value.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `[show_hidden]` - Whether to use show hidden commands in help. Leave blank to toggle.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        允许帮助命令显示隐藏命令。\n"
"\n"
"        默认值为 False。\n"
"        不提供设置则会切换。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset showhidden True` - 启用显示隐藏命令。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset showhidden` - 切换值。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `[show_hidden]` - 是否在帮助中显示隐藏命令。留空以切换。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4407
msgid "Help will not filter hidden commands."
msgstr "帮助将不过滤隐藏命令。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4409
msgid "Help will filter hidden commands."
msgstr "帮助将过滤隐藏命令。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4413
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        This allows the help command to show existing commands aliases if there is any.\n"
"\n"
"        This defaults to True.\n"
"        Using this without a setting will toggle.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset showaliases False` - Disables showing aliases on this server.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset showaliases` - Toggles the value.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `[show_aliases]` - Whether to include aliases in help. Leave blank to toggle.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        允许帮助命令显示现有命令的别名（如果有的话）。\n"
"\n"
"        默认值为 True。\n"
"        不提供设置则会切换。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset showaliases False` - 在此服务器上禁用显示别名。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset showaliases` - 切换值。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `[show_aliases]` - 是否在帮助中包含别名。留空以切换。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4430
msgid "Help will now show command aliases."
msgstr "帮助现在将显示命令别名。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4432
msgid "Help will no longer show command aliases."
msgstr "帮助将不再显示命令别名。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4436
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        This allows the help command message to be ticked if help is sent to a DM.\n"
"\n"
"        Ticking is reacting to the help message with a ✅.\n"
"\n"
"        Defaults to False.\n"
"        Using this without a setting will toggle.\n"
"\n"
"        Note: This is only used when the bot is not using menus.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usetick False` - Disables ticking when help is sent to DMs.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usetick` - Toggles the value.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `[use_tick]` - Whether to tick the help command when help is sent to DMs. Leave blank to toggle.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        当帮助被发送到私信时，允许对帮助命令消息进行打勾标记。\n"
"\n"
"        打勾标记是用 ✅ 对帮助消息做出反应。\n"
"\n"
"        默认值为 False。\n"
"        不提供设置则会切换。\n"
"\n"
"        注意：仅在机器人不使用菜单时使用。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usetick False` - 当帮助发送到私信时禁用打勾标记。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset usetick` - 切换值。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `[use_tick]` - 当帮助发送到私信时是否对帮助命令进行打勾标记。留空以切换。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4457
msgid "Help will now tick the command when sent in a DM."
msgstr "当发送到私信时，帮助现在将对命令进行打勾标记。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4459
msgid "Help will not tick the command when sent in a DM."
msgstr "当发送到私信时，帮助将不对命令进行打勾标记。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4463
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Sets if commands which can't be run in the current context should be filtered from help.\n"
"\n"
"        Defaults to True.\n"
"        Using this without a setting will toggle.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset verifychecks False` - Enables showing unusable commands in help.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset verifychecks` - Toggles the value.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `[verify]` - Whether to hide unusable commands in help. Leave blank to toggle.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        设置是否从帮助中过滤掉在当前上下文中无法运行的命令。\n"
"\n"
"        默认值为 True。\n"
"        不提供设置则会切换。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset verifychecks False` - 启用在帮助中显示无法使用的命令。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset verifychecks` - 切换值。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `[verify]` - 是否在帮助中隐藏无法使用的命令。留空以切换。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4480
msgid "Help will only show for commands which can be run."
msgstr "帮助将仅显示可运行的命令。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4482
msgid "Help will show up without checking if the commands can be run."
msgstr "帮助将显示，不检查命令是否可运行。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4486
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Sets whether the bot should respond to help commands for nonexistent topics.\n"
"\n"
"        When enabled, this will indicate the existence of help topics, even if the user can't use it.\n"
"\n"
"        Note: This setting on its own does not fully prevent command enumeration.\n"
"\n"
"        Defaults to False.\n"
"        Using this without a setting will toggle.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset verifyexists True` - Enables sending help for nonexistent topics.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset verifyexists` - Toggles the value.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `[verify]` - Whether to respond to help for nonexistent topics. Leave blank to toggle.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        设置机器人是否应响应不存在主题的帮助命令。\n"
"\n"
"        启用后，这将指示帮助主题的存在，即使该用户无法使用。\n"
"\n"
"        注意：此设置本身并不能完全防止命令枚举。\n"
"\n"
"        默认值为 False。\n"
"        不提供设置则会切换。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset verifyexists True` - 启用为不存在主题发送帮助。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset verifyexists` - 切换值。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `[verify]` - 是否响应不存在主题的帮助。留空以切换。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4507
msgid "Help will verify the existence of help topics."
msgstr "帮助将验证帮助主题的存在。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4510
msgid ""
"Help will only verify the existence of help topics via fuzzy help (if "
"enabled)."
msgstr "帮助将仅通过模糊帮助（如果启用）验证帮助主题的存在。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4518
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Set the character limit for each page in the help message.\n"
"\n"
"        Note: This setting only applies to embedded help.\n"
"\n"
"        The default value is 1000 characters. The minimum value is 500.\n"
"        The maximum is based on the lower of what you provide and what discord allows.\n"
"\n"
"        Please note that setting a relatively small character limit may\n"
"        mean some pages will exceed this limit.\n"
"\n"
"        **Example:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset pagecharlimit 1500`\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `<limit>` - The max amount of characters to show per page in the help message.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"设置帮助消息中每页的字符限制。\n"
"\n"
"        注意：此设置仅适用于嵌入帮助。\n"
"\n"
"        默认值为1000个字符。最小值为500。\n"
"        最大值基于你提供的值和 Discord 允许的值中的较小者。\n"
"\n"
"        请注意，设置相对较小的字符限制可能\n"
"        意味着某些页面将超过此限制。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset pagecharlimit 1500`\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `<limit>` - 帮助消息中每页显示的最大字符数。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4535
msgid "You must give a value of at least 500 characters."
msgstr "你必须给出至少500个字符的值。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4539
msgid "Done. The character limit per page has been set to {}."
msgstr "完成。每页的字符限制已设置为 {}。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4543
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of help pages sent in a server channel.\n"
"\n"
"        If a help message contains more pages than this value, the help message will\n"
"        be sent to the command author via DM. This is to help reduce spam in server\n"
"        text channels.\n"
"\n"
"        The default value is 2 pages.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset maxpages 50` - Basically never send help to DMs.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset maxpages 0` - Always send help to DMs.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `<limit>` - The max pages allowed to send per help in a server.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"设置服务器频道中发送帮助消息的最大页数。\n"
"\n"
"        如果帮助消息包含的页数超过此值，帮助消息将\n"
"        通过私信发送给命令作者。这是为了帮助减少服务器\n"
"        文字频道中的垃圾信息。\n"
"\n"
"        默认值为2页。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset maxpages 50` - 基本上从不将帮助发送到私信。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset maxpages 0` - 总是将帮助发送到私信。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `<limit>` - 在服务器中每次帮助允许发送的最大页数。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4559 redbot/core/core_commands.py:4586
msgid "You must give a value of zero or greater!"
msgstr "你必须给出零或更大的值"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4563
msgid "Done. The page limit has been set to {}."
msgstr "完成。页面限制已设置为 {}"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4568
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Set the delay after which help pages will be deleted.\n"
"\n"
"        The setting is disabled by default, and only applies to non-menu help,\n"
"        sent in server text channels.\n"
"        Setting the delay to 0 disables this feature.\n"
"\n"
"        The bot has to have MANAGE_MESSAGES permission for this to work.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset deletedelay 60` - Delete the help pages after a minute.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset deletedelay 1` - Delete the help pages as quickly as possible.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset deletedelay 1209600` - Max time to wait before deleting (14 days).\n"
"        - `[p]helpset deletedelay 0` - Disable deleting help pages.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `<seconds>` - The seconds to wait before deleting help pages.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"设置帮助页面删除的延迟时间。\n"
"\n"
"        此设置默认禁用，仅适用于非菜单帮助，\n"
"        在服务器文字频道中发送。\n"
"        将延迟设置为0会禁用此功能。\n"
"\n"
"        机器人必须拥有 MANAGE_MESSAGES 权限才能使其工作。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset deletedelay 60` - 在一分钟后删除帮助页面。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset deletedelay 1` - 尽快删除帮助页面。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset deletedelay 1209600` - 删除前的最长等待时间（14天）。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset deletedelay 0` - 禁用删除帮助页面。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `<seconds>` - 删除帮助页面前等待的秒数。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4589
msgid "The delay cannot be longer than 14 days!"
msgstr "延迟不能超过 14天"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4594
msgid "Done. Help messages will not be deleted now."
msgstr "完成。帮助消息现在不会被删除"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4596
msgid "Done. The delete delay has been set to {} seconds."
msgstr "完成。删除延迟已设置为 {} 秒"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4600
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Set the timeout for reactions, if menus are enabled.\n"
"\n"
"        The default is 30 seconds.\n"
"        The timeout has to be between 15 and 300 seconds.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset reacttimeout 30` - The default timeout.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset reacttimeout 60` - Timeout of 1 minute.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset reacttimeout 15` - Minimum allowed timeout.\n"
"        - `[p]helpset reacttimeout 300` - Max allowed timeout (5 mins).\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `<seconds>` - The timeout, in seconds, of the reactions.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"如果启用了菜单，设置反应的超时时间。\n"
"\n"
"        默认值为30秒。\n"
"        超时必须在15到300秒之间。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset reacttimeout 30` - 默认超时。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset reacttimeout 60` - 1分钟超时。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset reacttimeout 15` - 最小允许超时。\n"
"        - `[p]helpset reacttimeout 300` - 最大允许超时（5分钟）。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `<seconds>` - 反应的超时时间，以秒为单位。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4615
msgid "You must give a value of at least 15 seconds!"
msgstr "你必须给出至少15秒的值！"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4618
msgid "The timeout cannot be greater than 5 minutes!"
msgstr "超时不能超过5分钟！"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4622
msgid "Done. The reaction timeout has been set to {} seconds."
msgstr "完成。反应超时已设置为 {} 秒。"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4626
#, docstring
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Set the tagline to be used.\n"
"\n"
"        The maximum tagline length is 2048 characters.\n"
"        This setting only applies to embedded help. If no tagline is specified, the default will be used instead.\n"
"\n"
"        You can use `[​p]` in your tagline, which will be replaced by the bot's prefix.\n"
"\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset tagline Thanks for using the bot!`\n"
"        - `[p]helpset tagline Use [​p]invite to add me to your server.`\n"
"        - `[p]helpset tagline` - Resets the tagline to the default.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `[tagline]` - The tagline to appear at the bottom of help embeds. Leave blank to reset.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        设置要使用的标语。\n"
"\n"
"        最大标语长度为2048个字符。\n"
"        此设置仅适用于嵌入帮助。如果未指定标语，将使用默认值。\n"
"\n"
"        你可以在标语中使用 `[​p]`，它将被替换为机器人的前缀。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]helpset tagline Thanks for using the bot!`\n"
"        - `[p]helpset tagline Use [​p]invite to add me to your server.`\n"
"        - `[p]helpset tagline` - 将标语重置为默认值。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `[tagline]` - 显示在帮助嵌入底部的标语。留空以重置。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4644
msgid "The tagline has been reset."
msgstr "标语已重置"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4648
msgid ""
"Your tagline is too long! Please shorten it to be no more than 2048 "
"characters long."
msgstr "你的标语太长了!!! 请缩短，长度不超过2048个字"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4656
msgid "The tagline has been set."
msgstr "已设置标语"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4661
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Sends a message to the owner.\n"
"\n"
"        This is limited to one message every 60 seconds per person.\n"
"\n"
"        **Example:**\n"
"        - `[p]contact Help! The bot has become sentient!`\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `[message]` - The message to send to the owner.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"向所有者发送消息。\n"
"\n"
"        每人每60秒限发一条消息。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]contact Help! The bot has become sentient!`\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `[message]` - 发送给所有者的消息。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4673
msgid "User ID: {}"
msgstr "用户 ID：{}"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4676
msgid "through DM"
msgstr "通过DM"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4678
msgid "from {}"
msgstr "从 {}"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4679
msgid " | Server ID: {}"
msgstr " | 服务器 ID: {}"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4684
msgid "Use `{}dm {} <text>` to reply to this user"
msgstr "使用 \"{} dm {} <text>\" 来答复此用户"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4686
msgid "Sent by {} {}"
msgstr "发送人 {} {}"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4691
msgid "I've been configured not to send this anywhere."
msgstr "我已被配置为没有发送到任何地方"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4737
msgid "Your message has been sent."
msgstr "你的消息已发送"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4739
msgid "I'm unable to deliver your message. Sorry."
msgstr "抱歉，我无法发送你的消息"

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4744
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Sends a DM to a user.\n"
"\n"
"        This command needs a user ID to work.\n"
"\n"
"        To get a user ID, go to Discord's settings and open the 'Appearance' tab.\n"
"        Enable 'Developer Mode', then right click a user and click on 'Copy ID'.\n"
"\n"
"        **Example:**\n"
"        - `[p]dm 262626262626262626 Do you like me? Yes / No`\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `[message]` - The message to dm to the user.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"向用户发送私信。\n"
"\n"
"        此命令需要用户ID才能工作。\n"
"\n"
"        要获取用户ID，请前往Discord设置并打开'外观'选项卡。\n"
"        启用'开发者模式'，然后右键点击用户并点击'复制ID'。\n"
"\n"
"        **示例：**\n"
"        - `[p]dm 262626262626262626 Do you like me? Yes / No`\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"        - `[message]` - 发送给用户的私信消息。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/core/core_commands.py:4760
msgid ""
"Invalid ID, user not found, or user is a bot. You can only send messages to "
"people I share a server with."
